    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis 215 sqm home offers two living rooms, dining room, kitchen/dining room, 5 bedrooms (2 with ensuite) and wet room, along with two large detached garage areas.\n\nSet on a wonderful site with mature planted borders, patio areas and very usable outdoor accommodation, this 215 sqm detached bungalow is a wonderful family home, whatever you might need space for.\nIn terms of location, Oulart village is approximately 0.6 km away with amenities such as shop, church, school and GAA park, Oulart is an easy drive to Enniscorthy, Gorey and Wexford Town.\nThis bungalow, built in 1963, offers great accommodation including two large living/family rooms with feature open fires, a formal dining room leading into the kitchen/dining to the rear with utility and storage areas off this. The other side of the bungalow offers five double bedrooms, two with en-suites, and family bathroom/wet room.\nOutside there is lots of parking with two double garages, lean-to/storage area, large single garage with sliding door and car port.\nThis home has something for everyone be that a large family home, office/study spaces, entertainment areas, or someone who needs the garage space for business or hobbies.\nSeptic tank, well water, 125 sqm detached bungalow, very usable outbuildings.\nSite size to be confirmed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.1m x 1.4m\nwith carpet flooring, arch to the rear corridor, glazed panels either side of the doorDouble doors to......\n\nLiving Room 1 - 5.5m x 4.5m\nwith carpet flooring, two front facing windows and sliding door to raised SE facing patio area, open fire in marble surround\n\nLiving Room 2 - 5.3m x 4.4m\ndouble aspect room with bay window to the front and with laminate flooringGlazed double doors to ....\n\nFormal Dining Room - 4.8m x 3.6m\nwith laminate flooring and window to the side\n\nKitchen/Dining Area - \n\n\nKitchen - 4.9m x 4.3m\ndouble aspect room with tiled flooring, door to rear porch, waist and eye level units, gas hob, eye level oven and microwave\n\nDining Area - 3.6m x 3.3m\nwith timber flooring, built-in storage, rear window and skylight\n\nRear Porch - 2.6m x 1.4m\nwith tiled floor and sliding door\n\nUtility Room - 2.9m x 1.3m\nfully tiled and plumbed (washing machine and tumble dryer in press to the rear), rear window and attic hatch\n\nStorage Room - 1.8m x 0.9m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.8m x 4.5m\nwith carpet flooring and bay window to the front.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.5m x 3.3m\nwith carpet flooring, feature arches over bed areas\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.8m x 2.4m\nwith carpet flooring and attic hatch (stira access and limited storage)\n\nBathroom - 2.1m x 1.8m\nfully tiled wetroom area - WC, WHB and electric shower\n\nBedroom 4 - 6.1m x 3.7m\ndouble aspect room with carpet flooring, 3.2m wide of mirrored wardrobe. Room measurement includes en-suite\n\nEn-Suite - 2.7m x 0.7m\nfully tiled with WC, WHB and electric shower\n\nBedroom 5 - 4.4m x 3.5m\nwith carpet flooring, built in wardrobe and hot press. Room measurement includes en-suite area\n\nEn-Suite - 2.8m x 0.7m\nwith tiled flooring and part-tiled walls, WC, WHB and electric shower\n\nOUTSIDE - \n\n\nDouble Garage - 10.8m x 6.5m\nwith two up-and-over doors\n\nLean-to - 10.8m x 2.4m\nhandy storage area\n\nGarage - 8.9m x 6.1m\nwith sliding door\n\nCar Port - 10.1m x 3.7m\n\n\n"
      },
